### function body is a plain command
greet() echo hello
>>> SC1064 1:9
>>> SC1072 1:9
>>> SC1073 1:1

### function keyword followed by a plain command
function shout echo HELLO
>>> SC1064 1:16
>>> SC1072 1:16
>>> SC1073 1:1

### brace body
greet() { echo hello; }
>>> none

### subshell body
greet() ( echo hello )
>>> none
